# Moddy Arena: the Arena Guide. On his first arrival the core gives him the world's guide book (the Arena Guide, from
# the manifest's guide.book) and the arena moves it from the hotbar into his bag, so the hotbar stays for his wishes.
# He takes it from his bag onto his hotbar (a shift-click in his inventory), opens it and reads it: the first page, and
# a page whose number comes from the rules in force (lives), filled in by the arena's charge when the book is given.
@intent on his first arrival he gets the Arena Guide in his bag, not on his hotbar, and its pages show the rules' numbers
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive: the guide is in his bag
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@expect chat Here is your Arena Guide book within 20s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if items entity @s inventory.* minecraft:written_book
@assert execute unless items entity @s hotbar.* minecraft:written_book

@step he reads it
# in survival, so the inventory key opens his own inventory
gamemode survival
@key key.inventory
@expect screen Inventory within 5s
@click item "Arena Guide" shift
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.2 minecraft:written_book
@key key.hotbar.3
@wait 5t
# the lives page as given: its number is the rules' lives (3 in the arena's own rules), filled in from the arena's charge
@assert execute if data entity @s SelectedItem.components."minecraft:written_book_content".pages[{raw:"Lives\n\nYou have 3 lives in a battle.\n\nKnocked out? You go back to the prep room with your hotbar, and run back in!"}]
@key key.use
@expect screen /book/ within 5s
@wait 10t
@shot guide-first-page
@key key.keyboard.page.down
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.page.down
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.page.down
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.page.down
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.page.down
@wait 10t
@shot guide-lives-page
@key key.keyboard.page.down
@wait 10t
@shot guide-breaks-page
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s
